_:b244_b0 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ref.gs1.org/epcis/EPCISDocument> .
_:b244_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  AggregationEvent, action=OBSERVE, bizStep=receiving, disposition=in_progress." .
_:b244_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  bizTransactionList type=recadv = reference document type + number KDEs." .
_:b244_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  childQuantityList.epcClass = TLC (GTIN+Batch/Lot) KDE + product description + quantity/uom KDEs." .
_:b244_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  destinationList type=location = receiving location GLN." .
_:b244_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  parentID = SSCC Digital Link of the shipped pallet." .
_:b244_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  readPoint = Location GLN where the food was received KDE." .
_:b244_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  sourceList type=location = immediate previous source location GLN KDE." .
_:b244_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "" .
_:b244_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A prior TransformationEvent (creating_class_instance) is included for completeness; it documents" .
_:b244_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "NO usfsma: extension fields ride inside the event." .
_:b244_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Pattern used: 'Aggregation Observe' variant (§7, pages 42-44)." .
_:b244_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Receiving CTE per GS1 US 'EPCIS Recommendations for FSMA 204 CTEs' R2.0, §7." .
_:b244_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Receiving event itself:" .
_:b244_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "references it via sourceList." .
_:b244_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "the origin of the TLCs being received. In practice the upstream party captures this event; the receiver" .
